        "content": "## Missed-Call Text-Back (TEMPLATE)\nPlaceholders: Twilio credential id REPLACE_TWILIO_CRED_ID, env TWILIO_FROM, CFG block in Code nodes (business, links, owner phone, blocklist).\n\nWire Twilio voice status callback -> /webhook/missed-call-status, messaging webhook -> /webhook/missed-call-inbound-sms, booking/FSM -> /webhook/missed-call-close {phone, reason}.\n\nState kept in workflow static data (only persists for ACTIVE workflows; swap for a DB/Sheet in production). Quiet hours 8PM-8AM Arizona for SMS 2/3. Cap 3 msgs. A2P 10DLC registration required before going live.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520
      },
